WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.590
A man sits at a writing desk, pen in hand.

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.070
As he writes, the page
fills with a misty marsh,

3
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.570
and a small boy running across it.

4
00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:14.670
He writes of that boy: "the small bundle
of shivers growing afraid of it all and

5
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.330
beginning to cry, was Pip".

6
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.920
The man and the boy glance at
each other across the page.

7
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.910
Both of them are Pip.

8
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.510
So which one should you listen to?

9
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.560
In this mission, you'll meet the
retrospective first-person narrator:

10
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.830
the older Pip, telling the
story of the younger one.

11
00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.300
And you'll track the images that
drift through the whole novel:

12
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:40.120
a rising mist, a chain, a stopped clock.

13
00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:43.630
Your mission: decide which
Pip you should listen to.
